This product bundles third-party data in app/src/main/res/raw/ (world_cities.tsv, world_land.bin),
generated by scripts/world-clock/generate.py from the inputs pinned in scripts/world-clock/data-sources.lock.

Place data (c) GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  The time zone of each place comes from GeoNames cities5000. Changes made: places were joined with
  Natural Earth, zones canonicalised through IANA backward links and validated against IANA zone.tab,
  and only the zone and GeoNames id were kept.

Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data @ naturalearthdata.com
  ne_10m_populated_places and ne_110m_land are in the public domain,
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

Time zone rules: IANA Time Zone Database, https://www.iana.org/time-zones
  zone.tab and backward are in the public domain.
